es for so many nights in a row before you actually want to get out of house and do something and be with other people.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2022 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2022-05-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Stephenson","x":"We actually have 16% fewer people at the end of Q1 ‘22, than we did at the end of Q1 2020, before we had our layoffs, and yet, we think we're being more productive than ever before.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2022 Q3","e":"abnb","d":"2022-11-01","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"The movie theater is now Netflix, people still want to get out of their house.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2022 Q4","e":"abnb","d":"2023-02-14","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"And for many people, the office is now Zoom, the Mall of now Amazon, the theater is now Netflix.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2022 Q4","e":"abnb","d":"2023-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"And I think that we're one of the few tech companies that isn't doing layoffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2022 Q4","e":"abnb","d":"2023-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jed Kelly","x":"In Silicon Valley, there's obviously a lot of layoffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2023 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2023-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Stephenson","x":"We made some very difficult choices in the midst of COVID to rationalize and streamline the company, get focused, get back to our roots.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2023 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2023-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Stephenson","x":"We obviously reduced our headcount by 25%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2023 Q2","e":"abnb","d":"2023-08-03","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"As I'm sure you know, the Barbie movie just came out in theaters.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2024 Q3","e":"abnb","d":"2024-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"…second chapter which are probably in now exiting was the beginning of the pandemic, we lost 80% of our business and then we had the right size the company, become really profitable, go public, listing the customer feedback and really strengthen the foundation for the next chapter of the company.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2024 Q4","e":"abnb","d":"2025-02-13","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ellie Mertz","x":"So to restate, or just reiterate the guidance that we provide for the full year, we're going to invest $200 and $250 million in terms of launching and scaling the new businesses.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ABNB 2025 Q3","e":"abnb","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ellie Mertz","x":"So you should anticipate that across Experience and Services, across hotels, across AI, we will be investing in those next year to drive growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/airbnb-abnb-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2025 Q4","e":"abnb","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Nowak","x":"Any help at all on how you're thinking about the impact on gross margins from increased AI investment this year versus last year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/airbnb-abnb-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2025 Q4","e":"abnb","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"So our investment in AI will not affect the P&L. I don't think you'll see it in the P&L. That's number one.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/airbnb-abnb-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ellie Mertz","x":"We will continue to prioritize reinvestment to support further growth across the business, specifically on efficient marketing spend, international expansion, and AI initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/airbnb-abnb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"In order to be good at AI, you need strong foundational technology and great data infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/airbnb-abnb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"When tariff uncertainty led to fewer people traveling to the U.S. last year, they came to Airbnb, Inc. and found somewhere else to go.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/airbnb-abnb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ellie Mertz","x":"We have also made product changes to help in particular markets—for example, restructuring displays for popular bed-and-breakfasts in Italy, and tailoring feature sets to specific country preferences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/airbnb-abnb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ellie Mertz","x":"Finally, for the full year 2026, we are raising our guidance and now expect year-over-year revenue growth to accelerate to low to mid-teens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/airbnb-abnb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q1","e":"abnb","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ellie Mertz","x":"To close, our confidence in the increased full-year outlook we provided is grounded in the trends we are seeing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/airbnb-abnb-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q2","e":"abnb","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ellie Mertz","x":"I would just add tactically, in the updated guidance that we provided, it obviously does assume a material increase in terms of the AI spend over the course of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/airbnb-abnb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q2","e":"abnb","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ellie Mertz","x":"Even against tougher comps in the back half of the year, we are raising our full year guidance for both top line growth and profitability, a reflection of the pace of innovation, the operating momentum, and the execution we are seeing across the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/airbnb-abnb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q2","e":"abnb","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"It's given us so much confidence in the second half of this year, that's why we're raising our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/airbnb-abnb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q3","e":"abnb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"Now I want to spend a few minutes talking about AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/06/airbnb-abnb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ABNB 2026 Q3","e":"abnb","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Chesky","x":"And with the momentum we're seeing across the business,